    </div>

    <div class="sy-card" style="padding: 20px;">
      <div style="color: #E58A2B; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;">★★★★★</div>
      <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: #151414; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px;">
        "Saw this on my FYP at 2am and impulse bought. Best decision ever. The ice-silk cover stays cold and the neck support is incredible."
      </p>
      <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #0D5C3A;">David K. · Verified Buyer 🇬🇧</div>
    </div>

    <div class="sy-card" style="padding: 20px;">
      <div style="color: #E58A2B; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 8px;">★★★★★</div>
      <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: #151414; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px;">
        "Superior quality to $150 orthopedic pillows at department stores. Shipped fast via USPS with tracking. 10/10 recommend."
      </p>
      <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #0D5C3A;">Elena R. · Verified Buyer 🇨🇦</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
